  <div id="sutta">
  
                <h3 id="AN5.202" class="h1">Listening to the Dhamma<br/>
                  Dhammassavana Sutta  (AN 5:202)</h3><!--end suttahead-->
                <p>“There are these five rewards in listening to the Dhamma. Which five?</p>
                <p>“One hears what one has not heard before. One clarifies what one has heard before. One gets rid of doubt. One’s views are made straight. One’s mind grows serene.</p>
                <p>“These are the five rewards in listening to the Dhamma.”</p>
                <p class="seealso">See also: <a href="AN5_159.html">AN 5:159</a>; <a href="AN6_86.html">AN 6:86—88</a></p><!--end seealso-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
